   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "# cost · ADR-0015 (projection)\nidle floor    ≈ $0.45 / month (storage only)\nper session   ≈ $0.15 (search idle tail ≈ $0.13)\nprojected     ≈ $4 / month at 20 sessions\nworst case    ≈ $30 / month under the guards\nkill switch   $100 · alerts at $10 and $25\nrejected      SnapStart (≈ $11.70/mo idle),\n              provisioned concurrency, NAT",
   "originalText": "# cost · ADR-0015 (projection)\nidle floor    ≈ $0.45 / month (storage only)\nper session   ≈ $0.15 (search idle tail ≈ $0.13)\nprojected     ≈ $4 / month at 20 sessions\nworst case    ≈ $30 / month under the guards\nkill switch   $100 · alerts at $10 and $25\nrejected      SnapStart (≈ $11.70/mo idle),\n              provisioned concurrency, NAT",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
