   "text": "# guards · nothing can run away\nguest        1 live job / session\n             3 / IP / day · 20 / day overall\nsearch       awake ≤ 45 min / day\nconcurrency  web 10 · api 10 · worker 3 (queue 2)\nstream       ≤ 5 min per response, reconnect\nedge         unsigned → refused before invoke\ndeadline     10 min, expired lazily on read",
   "originalText": "# guards · nothing can run away\nguest        1 live job / session\n             3 / IP / day · 20 / day overall\nsearch       awake ≤ 45 min / day\nconcurrency  web 10 · api 10 · worker 3 (queue 2)\nstream       ≤ 5 min per response, reconnect\nedge         unsigned → refused before invoke\ndeadline     10 min, expired lazily on read",
