   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "FAILURE DOMAIN\n\nus-east-1 holds every stateful component.\nRegion loss = outage, documented, not built.\n\nCheapest mitigations: S3 CRR · backup copies\n· ECR replica · DynamoDB global tables\n· warm standby (≈ free while idle here)",
   "originalText": "FAILURE DOMAIN\n\nus-east-1 holds every stateful component.\nRegion loss = outage, documented, not built.\n\nCheapest mitigations: S3 CRR · backup copies\n· ECR replica · DynamoDB global tables\n· warm standby (≈ free while idle here)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
